      "id": "claim_1d01b5ecbc2041fc93f1183ac7e0d46d",
      "statement": "Settings::SwitchableSetting retains a global value and a custom value for a setting. SetGlobal selects the active slot, and the getter can explicitly request the global value. The type registers a restoration callback, so selecting the global slot again also works for settings added through the same linkage.",
