      "id": "claim_e459242e69c1454b8d6837861f8080f8",
      "statement": "FrontendCommon::Config reads persisted keys into the shared settings registry. Its generic reader distinguishes a custom configuration from the global one, reads the per-setting global flag for switchable settings, and loads the appropriate value. QtConfig wraps the shared reload and save routines with its own GUI value handling.",
